{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821550/extras/fcd0b9547c6ea3432e52f07fd9b4c2ed.avif?t=1750431528\" width=800 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821550/extras/f0132786013831b2fca08945bfb1397b.poster.avif?t=1750431528\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821550/extras/f0132786013831b2fca08945bfb1397b.webm?t=1750431528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821550/extras/f0132786013831b2fca08945bfb1397b.mp4?t=1750431528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules are simple.\u00a0 Mouse cars are small and slow.\u00a0 Cat cars are big and fast.\u00a0 The team whose mouse car passes the finish line first is the winner.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each team has one mouse and at least one cat.\u00a0 Cats do everything they can to keep the competitors' mouse cars from getting the lead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821550/extras/1b2113c83ebd382bf3a2081dc0d0664d.avif?t=1750431528\" width=800 height=73 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821550/extras/8566400463cd93e0314225146021f9b4.poster.avif?t=1750431528\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821550/extras/8566400463cd93e0314225146021f9b4.webm?t=1750431528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821550/extras/8566400463cd93e0314225146021f9b4.mp4?t=1750431528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We love arcade racing games.\u00a0 We also love team-based cooperative racing games. Cat &amp; Mouse Racing is for fans of classic team-based racing competitions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat &amp; Mouse Racing combines  racing skill with team strategy, cooperation... and chaos.\u00a0 Lots of chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821550/extras/158eabb1db7af9e60391e05eecd98bde.avif?t=1750431528\" width=800 height=73 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821550/extras/3ee6550cdbbe4c012b566df1aa7cb246.poster.avif?t=1750431528\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821550/extras/3ee6550cdbbe4c012b566df1aa7cb246.webm?t=1750431528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821550/extras/3ee6550cdbbe4c012b566df1aa7cb246.mp4?t=1750431528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up your teams, assign mouse cars and cat cars.\u00a0 Everything is tuned for classic arcade team-based racing mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821550/extras/3bb7f6f4bfe37e4df455f32b8dfe753b.avif?t=1750431528\" width=800 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821550/extras/94c8a6868cef5b734eb14742581e4d16.poster.avif?t=1750431528\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821550/extras/94c8a6868cef5b734eb14742581e4d16.webm?t=1750431528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821550/extras/94c8a6868cef5b734eb14742581e4d16.mp4?t=1750431528\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat &amp;\u00a0 Mouse races are never over until they're over.\u00a0 Mouse positions can change on a dime.\u00a0 Lose focus just for a moment, and the whole race can change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821550/extras/5e7dc0fdc935a042d2cba8e5bab1640c.avif?t=1750431528\" width=800 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes your racing buddies aren't around when you want to jump on a race.\u00a0 Sometimes you're just short one player.\u00a0 Assign AI racers and get the skip the wait.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3821550?t=1750431528","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821550/33940ad5671fc07b1158ad424193f3b5995623b4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750431528","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821550/48f0f489563633ffc788e112b3a9df28598c4213/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750431528","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821550/48f0f489563633ffc788e112b3a9df28598c4213/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750431528","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1